span><span class="percent font-number">30%</span></td></tr><tr><td><span>Iron</span><span class="font-number"></span><span class="percent font-number">10%</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>* Percent Daily Values are based on a 2,000 calorie diet. Your Daily Values may be higher or lower depending on your calorie needs.</p></div></div></div><div class="wrapper tags-wrapper"><h3 class="title h4-text primary-dark">Recipe Tags</h3><ul class="recipe-tags"><li class="recipe-tag micro-text font-bold" title="Difficulty: Quick"><a class="tag-link primary-teal" title="Quick" aria-label="Quick" href="/recipes?q=Quick&amp;taste-pref-appended=true">Quick</a></li><li class="recipe-tag micro-text font-bold" title="Technique: Baking"><a class="tag-link primary-teal" title="Baking" aria-label="Baking" href="/recipes?q=Baking&amp;taste-pref-appended=true">Baking</a></li></ul></div><div class="reviews wrapper" id="reviews"><h3 class="h4-text">Reviews<span class="font-number font-normal p3-text">(20)</span></h3><div class="rating-average"><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="1" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="2" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="3" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="4" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon half-star y-icon" data-star-number="5" data-icon=""></span></div><div class="review media new-review"><img src="https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/1x1.png"/><div class="review-content"><a class="review-text font-normal p2-text" href="#"><strong>Connect to Yummly</strong> <!-- -->to review this recipe</a></div></div><div class="review media" id="2d2bb300-f7bd-4967-9991-fc8b74eb7c66"><a title="[object Object]&#x27;s Profile" aria-label="[object Object]&#x27;s Profile" href="/profile/OlympiaProdafikas"><img src="https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/1x1.png"/></a><div class="review-content"><div class="review-name"><a title="Olympia Prodafikas&#x27;s Profile" aria-label="Olympia Prodafikas&#x27;s Profile" href="/profile/OlympiaProdafikas">Olympia Prodafikas</a> <span class="font-bold greyscale-3 p3-text">15 days ago</span></div><div class="review-rating"><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="1" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="2" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="3" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="4" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="5" data-icon=""></span></div><div class="review-text font-normal p2-text">Great recipe! Substituted garlic with garlic powder and turned out just fine!</div></div></div><div class="review media" id="b1fc6f33-93a7-44b8-86b3-dd7ce3dc963c"><a title="[object Object]&#x27;s Profile" aria-label="[object Object]&#x27;s Profile" href="/profile/BooSchara"><img src="https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/1x1.png"/></a><div class="review-content"><div class="review-name"><a title="Boo s.&#x27;s Profile" aria-label="Boo s.&#x27;s Profile" href="/profile/BooSchara">Boo S.</a> <span class="font-bold greyscale-3 p3-text">21 days ago</span></div><div class="review-rating"><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="1" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="2" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="3" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="4" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="5" data-icon=""></span></div><div class="review-text font-normal p2-text">easy recipe. came out jist as planned. could use something else to boost flavor. maybe some goat cheese</div></div></div><div class="review media" id="4add77a0-85d6-4037-ae38-205c61313857"><a title="[object Object]&#x27;s Profile" aria-label="[object Object]&#x27;s Profile" href="/profile/Hi59098"><img src="https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/1x1.png"/></a><div class="review-content"><div class="review-name"><a title="Kimberly Watt&#x27;s Profile" aria-label="Kimberly Watt&#x27;s Profile" href="/profile/Hi59098">Kimberly Watt</a> <span class="font-bold greyscale-3 p3-text">a month ago</span></div><div class="review-rating"><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="1" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="2" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="3" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="4" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="5" data-icon=""></span></div><div class="review-text font-normal p2-text">The only part of the recipe I really follwed was the instructions to cook, I made my pizza with ranch and buffalo sauce as a base and mozzarella cheese on top. Came out really well!</div></div></div><div class="review media" id="8f9d5356-0709-4284-b66e-f55af3616aad"><a title="[object Object]&#x27;s Profile" aria-label="[object Object]&#x27;s Profile" href="/profile/RachaelHookano"><img src="https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/1x1.png"/></a><div class="review-content"><div class="review-name"><a title="Rachael Hookano&#x27;s Profile" aria-label="Rachael Hookano&#x27;s Profile" href="/profile/RachaelHookano">Rachael Hookano</a> <span class="font-bold greyscale-3 p3-text">a month ago</span></div><div class="review-rating"><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="1" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="2" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="3" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="4" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="5" data-icon=""></span></div><div class="review-text font-normal p2-text">Super easy and delicious! I took it out at 8 minutes because it was already very toasty (which I loved), any longer and it would have burnt. I didn’t have the basil but everything else complimented each other. The gooey cheese, the freshness of the herbs, and the slight saltiness of the Parmesan brought this dish together. It took me less than 20 minutes to prepare and cook this meal, which is always a plus.</div></div></div><div class="review media" id="8d6ee7b0-784f-4de8-821b-13e40ca87027"><a title="[object Object]&#x27;s Profile" aria-label="[object Object]&#x27;s Profile" href="/profile/Suzanne Carella"><img src="https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/1x1.png"/></a><div class="review-content"><div class="review-name"><a title="Suzanne C.&#x27;s Profile" aria-label="Suzanne C.&#x27;s Profile" href="/profile/Suzanne Carella">Suzanne C.</a> <span class="font-bold greyscale-3 p3-text">3 months ago</span></div><div class="review-rating"><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="1" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="2" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="3" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="4" data-icon=""></span><span class="icon full-star y-icon" data-star-number="5" data-icon=""></span></div><div class="review-text font-normal p2-text">Easy and delicious! I left at 15 min without checking beforehand so turned out a bit over cooked but otherwise it was great.</div></div></div><div class="review media" id="f29b769c-f697-4399-bab9-b15668c1339f"><a title="[object Object]&#x27;s Profile" aria-label="[object Object]&#x27;s Profile" href="/profile/OhGoshDanger."><img src="https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/1x1.png"/></a><div class="review-content"><div class="review-name"><a title="OhGoshDanger .&#x27;s Profile" aria-label="OhGoshDanger .&#x27;s Profile" href="/profile/OhGoshDanger.">OhGoshDanger .</a> <span class="font-bold greyscale-3 p3-text">3 months ago</span></div><div class="review-rating"><span class="icon full-star y-icon" d