 class="y-icon tag-arrow" data-icon=""></div></button><button aria-label="Next" type="right" class="button arrow-button arrow-right"><div class="y-icon tag-arrow" data-icon=""></div></button></div><div class="structured-data-info"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org/","@type":"Recipe","description":"Extra cheese and extra garlic? Yes, please! No red sauce is needed for these mouthwatering naan pizzas. The recipe is a Yummly original created by [Sara Mellas](https://www.yummly.com/dish/author/Sara%20Mellas).","image":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/UyOcAUtHtGMhwFNayuGToyY9V-S1vl9OOs8ycgXxJXevQDyHTkX5_luRkhU-hTHi4AlSkGA_lDUMxV-uQKfDFPY=w1920-h1920-c-rj-v1-e365","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/UyOcAUtHtGMhwFNayuGToyY9V-S1vl9OOs8ycgXxJXevQDyHTkX5_luRkhU-hTHi4AlSkGA_lDUMxV-uQKfDFPY=w1920-h1440-c-rj-v1-e365","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/UyOcAUtHtGMhwFNayuGToyY9V-S1vl9OOs8ycgXxJXevQDyHTkX5_luRkhU-hTHi4AlSkGA_lDUMxV-uQKfDFPY=w1920-h1080-c-rj-v1-e365"],"mainEntity":true,"name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas","video":[{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas","description":"Cooking video for Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas by Yummly on Yummly","contentUrl":"https://gv.yummlystatic.com/oYMx9Sg9SROzCXdUrr8Y_Montage_Easy_Pizza_White_Pizza/oYMx9Sg9SROzCXdUrr8Y_Montage_Easy_Pizza_White_Pizza-hls.m3u8","thumbnailUrl":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/UyOcAUtHtGMhwFNayuGToyY9V-S1vl9OOs8ycgXxJXevQDyHTkX5_luRkhU-hTHi4AlSkGA_lDUMxV-uQKfDFPY","uploadDate":"2021-02-13"}],"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Yummly"},"totalTime":"PT25M","recipeYield":4,"nutrition":{"@type":"NutritionInformation","calories":"380 calories","carbohydrateContent":"38 grams","cholesterolContent":"40 milligrams","fatContent":"18 grams","fiberContent":"2 grams","proteinContent":"16 grams","saturatedFatContent":"7 grams","sodiumContent":"590 milligrams","sugarContent":"1 grams"},"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":4.7,"reviewCount":20},"reviews":[{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2021-02-02","reviewBody":"Great recipe! Substituted garlic with garlic powder and turned out just fine!","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"OlympiaProdafikas"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2021-01-27","reviewBody":"easy recipe. came out jist as planned. could use something else to boost flavor. maybe some goat cheese","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"BooSchara"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2021-01-22","reviewBody":"The only part of the recipe I really follwed was the instructions to cook, I made my pizza with ranch and buffalo sauce as a base and mozzarella cheese on top. Came out really well!","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Hi95468"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2021-01-12","reviewBody":"Super easy and delicious! I took it out at 8 minutes because it was already very toasty (which I loved), any longer and it would have burnt. I didn’t have the basil but everything else complimented each other. The gooey cheese, the freshness of the herbs, and the slight saltiness of the Parmesan brought this dish together. It took me less than 20 minutes to prepare and cook this meal, which is always a plus.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"RachaelHookano"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2020-11-11","reviewBody":"Easy and delicious! I left at 15 min without checking beforehand so turned out a bit over cooked but otherwise it was great.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"SuzanneCarella"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2020-11-10","reviewBody":"really good. it tasted like it needed a sauce.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"OhGoshDanger."},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":4}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2020-09-30","reviewBody":"Super easy and filling!","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"EmilyHall14"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2020-08-16","reviewBody":"Great blend of flavors, and very quick and easy to make","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"EvanWahl"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2020-07-01","reviewBody":"Yummy- kids loved it","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"AnnaSnider5"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2018-08-21","reviewBody":"great with red pepper flakes!","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"CandaceMadry"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2018-06-21","reviewBody":"I modified it a bit I probably wouldn't make it again","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"RyleyPayne"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":3}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2018-06-17","reviewBody":"I added some lettuce and tomato to the side to make dinner, but it smelled delicious and cheesey the whole time i made it. I also improvised on the herbs a bit and it tasted as good as it looked","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"BrilliantCook379"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":4}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2018-06-13","reviewBody":"It was excellent! Hubby loved it too. \nMade a few additions like a thinly sliced tomato, mushrooms, yellow & orange peppers, & smoked mozzarella. \nYYYYYummmm...","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"AgileSousChef1693"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2018-05-27","reviewBody":"it was delicious I cooked the garlic cloves in olive oil for about 10 mins on low and then chopped and added to pizza. i also added italian sausage fresh mushrooms and white onions it was amazing.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Shawn3188"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2018-05-21","reviewBody":"Added garlic salt and sautéed baby Bella mushrooms. Very tasty.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Jb211"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":4}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2018-05-17","reviewBody":"It was really good. The downsides of it were the garlic tasted raw so I might sauté in a skillet beforehand next time & 14 minutes was too long in our oven so I will probably turn down the heat a little and cook it for a shorter time frame","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"StaceyCroley"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":4}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2018-05-09","reviewBody":"I did it on the grill instead very tasty","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"FantasticSousChef9841"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2018-05-08","reviewBody":"Very tasty- great way to use up leftover ricotta","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"NoobChef"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2018-05-03","reviewBody":"My family loved this!","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"CunningSousChef7594"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2018-04-30","reviewBody":"Really simple, fast and tasty recipe.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"KeenHomeChef833"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Easy White Cheese & Garlic Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}}],"cookingMethod":["Baking"],"keywords":"Quick, Baking","recipeIngredient":["4 pieces naan ","2 tablespoons extra-virgin olive oil ","3 cloves garlic ","1 cup shredded mozzarella cheese or shredded pizza blend cheese, 1 cup is 4 oz.","4 ounces ricotta cheese 4 oz. is 1 scant cup","1 1/2 teaspoons Italian seasoning ","2 tablespoons shaved Parmesan cheese for serving","basil leaves for garnish, optional"],"recipeInstructions":[{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Preheat oven to 425°F.","name":"Step 1: Preheat oven to 425…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Easy-White-Cheese-_-Garlic-Pizzas-9351327","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/UyOcAUtHtGMhwFNayuGToyY9V-S1vl9OOs8ycgXxJXevQDyHTkX5_luRkhU-hTHi4AlSkGA_lDUMxV-uQKfDFPY=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":1,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Line a baking sheet with parchment paper. ","name":"Step 2: Line a baking sheet…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Easy-White-Cheese-_-Garlic-Pizzas-9351327","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/UyOcAUtHtGMhwFNayuGToyY9V-S1vl9OOs8ycgXxJXevQDyHTkX5_luRkhU-hTHi4AlSkGA_lDUMxV-uQKfDFPY=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":2,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Arrange the naan on the baking sheet. Drizzle an equal amount of olive oil over the surface of each piece.","name":"Step 3: Arrange the naan on…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Easy-White-Cheese-_-Garlic-Pizzas-9351327","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/UyOcAUtHtGMhwFNayuGToyY9V-S1vl9OOs8ycgXxJXevQDyHTkX5_luRkhU-hTHi4AlSkGA_lDUMxV-uQKfDFPY=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":3,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Finely mince the garlic.","name":"Step 4: Finely mince the ga…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Easy-White-Cheese-_-Garlic-Pizzas-9351327","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/UyOcAUtHtGMhwFNayuGToyY9V-S1vl9OOs8ycgXxJXevQDyHTkX5_luRkhU-hTHi4AlSkGA_lDUMxV-uQKfDFPY=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":4,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Sprinkle the naan pizzas with the minced garlic. Sprinkle the shredded cheese over each naan piece. Drop small amounts of ricotta cheese equally over them. Sprinkle each pizza with Italian seasoning.","name":"Step 5: Sprinkle the naan p…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Easy-White-Cheese-_-Garlic-Pizzas-9351327","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/UyOcAUtHtGMhwFNayuGToyY9V-S1vl9OOs8ycgXxJXevQDyHTkX5_luRkhU-hTHi4AlSkGA_lDUMxV-uQKfDFPY=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":5,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Bake the pizzas on middle rack of oven until naan is crisp and cheese is bubbly and golden, 12-15 minutes.","name":"Step 6: Bake the pizzas on…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Easy-White-Cheese-_-Garlic-Pizzas-9351327","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/UyOcAUtHtGMhwFNayuGToyY9V-S1vl9OOs8ycgXxJXevQDyHTkX5_luRkhU-hTHi4AlSkGA_lDUMxV-uQKfDFPY=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":6,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Check to see that pizzas are done. Remove from oven or add time as needed.","name":"Step 7: Check to see that p…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Easy-White-Cheese-_-Garlic-Pizzas-9351327","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/UyOcAUtHtGMhwFNayuGToyY9V-S1vl9OOs8ycgXxJXevQDyHTkX5_luRkhU-hTHi4AlSkGA_lDUMxV-uQKfDFPY=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":7,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Allow pizzas to cool on baking sheet for 2-3 minutes. Top with basil ribbons and a sprinkle of Parmesan cheese, if desired, then slice and serve. Refrigerate leftovers in an airtight container for up to 2 days. Reheat in the oven at 350°F for 5-7 minutes.","name":"Step 8: Allow pizzas to coo…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Easy-White-Cheese-_-Garlic-Pizzas-9351327","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/UyOcAUtHtGMhwFNayuGToyY9V-S1vl9OOs8ycgXxJXevQDyHTkX5_luRkhU-hTHi4AlSkGA_lDUMxV-uQKfDFPY=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":8,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}}],"dateModified":"2021-02-10"}</script></div><div class="structured-data-info"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"ItemList","itemListElement":[{"@context":"https://schema.org/","@type":"Recipe","description":"Tender slices of eggplant and creamy dollops of ricotta make these naan pizzas perfect for when you're craving Eggplant Parmesan with a little extra something. The recipe is a Yummly original created by [Sara Mellas](https://www.yummly.com/dish/author/Sara%20Mellas).","image":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4Qxl5B5K55B0tDsRGs0msRFdxpxsouyP5EElSEDDcCCN-Oc4v7alVh97DmclgWSXpJUgP4f8LfH6Je2tVJrxEQ=w1920-h1920-c-rj-v1-e365","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4Qxl5B5K55B0tDsRGs0msRFdxpxsouyP5EElSEDDcCCN-Oc4v7alVh97DmclgWSXpJUgP4f8LfH6Je2tVJrxEQ=w1920-h1440-c-rj-v1-e365","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4Qxl5B5K55B0tDsRGs0msRFdxpxsouyP5EElSEDDcCCN-Oc4v7alVh97DmclgWSXpJUgP4f8LfH6Je2tVJrxEQ=w1920-h1080-c-rj-v1-e365"],"mainEntity":false,"name":"Quick & Easy Eggplant Naan Pizzas","video":[{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"Quick & Easy Eggplant Naan Pizzas","description":"Cooking video for Quick & Easy Eggplant Naan Pizzas by Yummly on Yummly","contentUrl":"https://gv.yummlystatic.com/8dlWnAQWQzurhB4j7XJw_Montage_Easy_Pizza_Eggplant/8dlWnAQWQzurhB4j7XJw_Montage_Easy_Pizza_Eggplant-hls.m3u8","thumbnailUrl":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4Qxl5B5K55B0tDsRGs0msRFdxpxsouyP5EElSEDDcCCN-Oc4v7alVh97DmclgWSXpJUgP4f8LfH6Je2tVJrxEQ","uploadDate":"2021-02-12"}],"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Yummly"},"totalTime":"PT20M","recipeYield":4,"nutrition":{"@type":"NutritionInformation","calories":"340 calories","carbohydrateContent":"37 grams","cholesterolContent":"40 milligrams","fatContent":"13 grams","fiberContent":"1 grams","proteinContent":"16 grams","saturatedFatContent":"7 grams","sodiumContent":"590 milligrams","sugarContent":"1 grams"},"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5,"reviewCount":8},"reviews":[{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2020-12-01","reviewBody":"Good and easy, but I have to reduce oven time next time for Whole Foods naan - came out with the bottom slightly burnt at 14 mins - 425 F.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"BestHomeCook4267"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Quick & Easy Eggplant Naan Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2020-11-29","reviewBody":"So easy. Was amazing, will do again","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"AmazingMike"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Quick & Easy Eggplant Naan Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}}],"cookingMethod":["Baking"],"keywords":"Quick, Baking","recipeIngredient":["4 pieces naan ","2 teaspoons extra-virgin olive oil ","1 small eggplant ","4 basil leaves ","2/3 cup pizza sauce or marinara sauce","1 cup mozzarella cheese or shredded pizza blend cheese, 1 cup is 4 oz.","4 ounces ricotta cheese 4 oz. is 1 scant cup","2 tablespoons shaved Parmesan cheese for serving"],"recipeInstructions":[{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Preheat oven to 425°F.","name":"Step 1: Preheat oven to 425…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-_-Easy-Eggplant-Naan-Pizzas-9351317","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4Qxl5B5K55B0tDsRGs0msRFdxpxsouyP5EElSEDDcCCN-Oc4v7alVh97DmclgWSXpJUgP4f8LfH6Je2tVJrxEQ=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":1,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Line a baking sheet with parchment paper. ","name":"Step 2: Line a baking sheet…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-_-Easy-Eggplant-Naan-Pizzas-9351317","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4Qxl5B5K55B0tDsRGs0msRFdxpxsouyP5EElSEDDcCCN-Oc4v7alVh97DmclgWSXpJUgP4f8LfH6Je2tVJrxEQ=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":2,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Arrange the naan on the baking sheet. Drizzle an equal amount of the olive oil over the surface of each piece.","name":"Step 3: Arrange the naan on…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-_-Easy-Eggplant-Naan-Pizzas-9351317","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4Qxl5B5K55B0tDsRGs0msRFdxpxsouyP5EElSEDDcCCN-Oc4v7alVh97DmclgWSXpJUgP4f8LfH6Je2tVJrxEQ=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":3,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Thinly slice the eggplant into 1/8-inch thick rounds. Cut each round in half.","name":"Step 4: Thinly slice the eg…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-_-Easy-Eggplant-Naan-Pizzas-9351317","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4Qxl5B5K55B0tDsRGs0msRFdxpxsouyP5EElSEDDcCCN-Oc4v7alVh97DmclgWSXpJUgP4f8LfH6Je2tVJrxEQ=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":4,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Stack the basil leaves and roll into a tight log. Make very thin slices across the log to create ribbons.","name":"Step 5: Stack the basil lea…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-_-Easy-Eggplant-Naan-Pizzas-9351317","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4Qxl5B5K55B0tDsRGs0msRFdxpxsouyP5EElSEDDcCCN-Oc4v7alVh97DmclgWSXpJUgP4f8LfH6Je2tVJrxEQ=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":5,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Divide the pizza sauce equally on each naan piece and spread it into an even layer, leaving a 1/2-inch border around the sauce.","name":"Step 6: Divide the pizza sa…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-_-Easy-Eggplant-Naan-Pizzas-9351317","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4Qxl5B5K55B0tDsRGs0msRFdxpxsouyP5EElSEDDcCCN-Oc4v7alVh97DmclgWSXpJUgP4f8LfH6Je2tVJrxEQ=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":6,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Spread eggplant slices evenly over each piece of naan, then add a sprinkling of shredded cheese, drops of ricotta cheese, and half of the basil ribbons. Reserve remaining basil for garnish.","name":"Step 7: Spread eggplant sli…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-_-Easy-Eggplant-Naan-Pizzas-9351317","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/4Qxl5B5K55B0tDsRGs0msRFdxpxsouyP5EElSEDDcCCN-Oc4v7alVh97DmclgWSXpJUgP4f8LfH6Je2tVJrxEQ=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":7,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Bake the pizzas on middle rack of oven until the naan is crisp and the cheese is bubbly and golden, 14-15 minutes.","name":"Step 8: Bake the pizzas on…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-_-Easy-Eggplant-Naan-Pizzas-9351317","image":"https://lh3.googleu