ieces naan ","4 strips bacon ","1 small tomatoes ","4 chives ","1 cup shredded mozzarella cheese 1 cup is 4 oz.","1/2 cup shredded cheddar cheese 1/2 cup is 2 oz.","4 large eggs ","1 avocado large","salt ","black pepper "],"recipeInstructions":[{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Preheat oven to 425°F.","name":"Step 1: Preheat oven to 425…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Super-Easy-Egg-and-Bacon-Naan-Pizzas-9351316","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/uUJOEe85yI_5Nf2JCELsFFD7GDxuKt_yk7w5CYSMtD2xlQ-KdM49OwP699OgV3l6eD9BI7ptql8vMA0je-G9Bw=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":1,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Line two large baking sheets with parchment paper. Set aside.","name":"Step 2: Line two large baki…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Super-Easy-Egg-and-Bacon-Naan-Pizzas-9351316","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/uUJOEe85yI_5Nf2JCELsFFD7GDxuKt_yk7w5CYSMtD2xlQ-KdM49OwP699OgV3l6eD9BI7ptql8vMA0je-G9Bw=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":2,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Line a large plate with paper towels. Set aside.","name":"Step 3: Line a large plate…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Super-Easy-Egg-and-Bacon-Naan-Pizzas-9351316","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/uUJOEe85yI_5Nf2JCELsFFD7GDxuKt_yk7w5CYSMtD2xlQ-KdM49OwP699OgV3l6eD9BI7ptql8vMA0je-G9Bw=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":3,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Place the butter in a microwave-safe bowl. Microwave on high until melted, 20-30 seconds.","name":"Step 4: Place the butter in…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Super-Easy-Egg-and-Bacon-Naan-Pizzas-9351316","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/uUJOEe85yI_5Nf2JCELsFFD7GDxuKt_yk7w5CYSMtD2xlQ-KdM49OwP699OgV3l6eD9BI7ptql8vMA0je-G9Bw=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":4,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Arrange the naan on one baking sheet, then brush the surface of each naan piece with melted butter.","name":"Step 5: Arrange the naan on…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Super-Easy-Egg-and-Bacon-Naan-Pizzas-9351316","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/uUJOEe85yI_5Nf2JCELsFFD7GDxuKt_yk7w5CYSMtD2xlQ-KdM49OwP699OgV3l6eD9BI7ptql8vMA0je-G9Bw=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":5,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Arrange the bacon strips on the other baking sheet.","name":"Step 6: Arrange the bacon s…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Super-Easy-Egg-and-Bacon-Naan-Pizzas-9351316","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/uUJOEe85yI_5Nf2JCELsFFD7GDxuKt_yk7w5CYSMtD2xlQ-KdM49OwP699OgV3l6eD9BI7ptql8vMA0je-G9Bw=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":6,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Halve the tomato and remove and discard the seeds. Dice tomato into 1/4 inch pieces.","name":"Step 7: Halve the tomato an…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Super-Easy-Egg-and-Bacon-Naan-Pizzas-9351316","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/uUJOEe85yI_5Nf2JCELsFFD7GDxuKt_yk7w5CYSMtD2xlQ-KdM49OwP699OgV3l6eD9BI7ptql8vMA0je-G9Bw=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":7,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Finely mince the chives. Set aside.","name":"Step 8: Finely mince the ch…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Super-Easy-Egg-and-Bacon-Naan-Pizzas-9351316","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/uUJOEe85yI_5Nf2JCELsFFD7GDxuKt_yk7w5CYSMtD2xlQ-KdM49OwP699OgV3l6eD9BI7ptql8vMA0je-G9Bw=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":8,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Sprinkle an equal amount of shredded mozzarella and cheddar cheeses over each pizza.","name":"Step 9: Sprinkle an equal a…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Super-Easy-Egg-and-Bacon-Naan-Pizzas-9351316","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/uUJOEe85yI_5Nf2JCELsFFD7GDxuKt_yk7w5CYSMtD2xlQ-KdM49OwP699OgV3l6eD9BI7ptql8vMA0je-G9Bw=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":9,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Carefully crack one egg into the center of each pizza.","name":"Step 10: Carefully crack one…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Super-Easy-Egg-and-Bacon-Naan-Pizzas-9351316","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/uUJOEe85yI_5Nf2JCELsFFD7GDxuKt_yk7w5CYSMtD2xlQ-KdM49OwP699OgV3l6eD9BI7ptql8vMA0je-G9Bw=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":10,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Bake the pizzas and bacon on the middle and upper-middle racks of oven until the cheese is golden, the eggs are fully cooked, and the bacon is browned and crisp, 14-16 minutes.","name":"Step 11: Bake the pizzas and…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Super-Easy-Egg-and-Bacon-Naan-Pizzas-9351316","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/uUJOEe85yI_5Nf2JCELsFFD7GDxuKt_yk7w5CYSMtD2xlQ-KdM49OwP699OgV3l6eD9BI7ptql8vMA0je-G9Bw=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":11,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Check to see that bacon and pizzas are done. Remove from oven or add time as needed.","name":"Step 12: Check to see that b…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Super-Easy-Egg-and-Bacon-Naan-Pizzas-9351316","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/uUJOEe85yI_5Nf2JCELsFFD7GDxuKt_yk7w5CYSMtD2xlQ-KdM49OwP699OgV3l6eD9BI7ptql8vMA0je-G9Bw=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":12,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Transfer the cooked bacon to the paper-towel-lined dinner plate to drain.","name":"Step 13: Transfer the cooked…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Super-Easy-Egg-and-Bacon-Naan-Pizzas-9351316","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/uUJOEe85yI_5Nf2JCELsFFD7GDxuKt_yk7w5CYSMtD2xlQ-KdM49OwP699OgV3l6eD9BI7ptql8vMA0je-G9Bw=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":13,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Halve the avocado and remove and discard the pit. Cut the avocado into 1/4-inch thick slices. Carefully scoop out the slices with a spoon.","name":"Step 14: Halve the avocado a…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Super-Easy-Egg-and-Bacon-Naan-Pizzas-9351316","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/uUJOEe85yI_5Nf2JCELsFFD7GDxuKt_yk7w5CYSMtD2xlQ-KdM49OwP699OgV3l6eD9BI7ptql8vMA0je-G9Bw=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":14,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Arrange equal amounts of avocado slices and diced tomatoes on each pizza. With clean hands, crumble the bacon and sprinkle evenly over the pizzas, then sprinkle with minced chives. Season with salt and pepper, to taste, and serve immediately.","name":"Step 15: Arrange equal amoun…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Super-Easy-Egg-and-Bacon-Naan-Pizzas-9351316","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/uUJOEe85yI_5Nf2JCELsFFD7GDxuKt_yk7w5CYSMtD2xlQ-KdM49OwP699OgV3l6eD9BI7ptql8vMA0je-G9Bw=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":15,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}}],"url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Super-Easy-Egg-and-Bacon-Naan-Pizzas-9351316","position":2},{"@context":"https://schema.org/","@type":"Recipe","description":"Both tangy and sweet, these naan pizzas are the perfect way to use up leftover rotisserie chicken. The recipe is a Yummly original created by [Sara Mellas](https://www.yummly.com/dish/author/Sara%20Mellas).","image":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ngYJ2DBsxPhw4hq3jt2SxVMvkxrOEMI5aACJxVKtDewwFGDwdv9MSswp8C1aK69S_ARnea5_yhM3DyIwaWLiqi4=w1920-h1920-c-rj-v1-e365","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ngYJ2DBsxPhw4hq3jt2SxVMvkxrOEMI5aACJxVKtDewwFGDwdv9MSswp8C1aK69S_ARnea5_yhM3DyIwaWLiqi4=w1920-h1440-c-rj-v1-e365","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ngYJ2DBsxPhw4hq3jt2SxVMvkxrOEMI5aACJxVKtDewwFGDwdv9MSswp8C1aK69S_ARnea5_yhM3DyIwaWLiqi4=w1920-h1080-c-rj-v1-e365"],"mainEntity":false,"name":"Quick and Easy Barbecue Chicken Naan Pizzas ","video":[{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"Quick and Easy Barbecue Chicken Naan Pizzas ","description":"Cooking video for Quick and Easy Barbecue Chicken Naan Pizzas  by Yummly on Yummly","contentUrl":"https://gv.yummlystatic.com/My46fp0QqqfSRejq0qYz_Montage_Easy_Pizza_BBQ_Chicken/My46fp0QqqfSRejq0qYz_Montage_Easy_Pizza_BBQ_Chicken-hls.m3u8","thumbnailUrl":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/n