bject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Cut the onion into 1/8-inch-thick slices.","name":"Step 5: Cut the onion into…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-and-Easy-Barbecue-Chicken-Naan-Pizzas--9350630","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ngYJ2DBsxPhw4hq3jt2SxVMvkxrOEMI5aACJxVKtDewwFGDwdv9MSswp8C1aK69S_ARnea5_yhM3DyIwaWLiqi4=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":5,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Arrange an equal amount of onion slices, shredded chicken, and the shredded cheeses onto each naan piece.","name":"Step 6: Arrange an equal am…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-and-Easy-Barbecue-Chicken-Naan-Pizzas--9350630","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ngYJ2DBsxPhw4hq3jt2SxVMvkxrOEMI5aACJxVKtDewwFGDwdv9MSswp8C1aK69S_ARnea5_yhM3DyIwaWLiqi4=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":6,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Bake the pizzas on lower-middle rack of oven until naan is crisp and the cheese is bubbly and golden, 13-15 minutes.","name":"Step 7: Bake the pizzas on…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-and-Easy-Barbecue-Chicken-Naan-Pizzas--9350630","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ngYJ2DBsxPhw4hq3jt2SxVMvkxrOEMI5aACJxVKtDewwFGDwdv9MSswp8C1aK69S_ARnea5_yhM3DyIwaWLiqi4=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":7,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Check to see that pizzas are done. Remove from oven or add time as needed.","name":"Step 8: Check to see that p…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-and-Easy-Barbecue-Chicken-Naan-Pizzas--9350630","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ngYJ2DBsxPhw4hq3jt2SxVMvkxrOEMI5aACJxVKtDewwFGDwdv9MSswp8C1aK69S_ARnea5_yhM3DyIwaWLiqi4=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":8,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Halve the tomato, then remove and discard the seeds. Dice tomato into 1/4-inch pieces.","name":"Step 9: Halve the tomato, t…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-and-Easy-Barbecue-Chicken-Naan-Pizzas--9350630","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ngYJ2DBsxPhw4hq3jt2SxVMvkxrOEMI5aACJxVKtDewwFGDwdv9MSswp8C1aK69S_ARnea5_yhM3DyIwaWLiqi4=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":9,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Roughly chop the cilantro leaves.","name":"Step 10: Roughly chop the ci…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-and-Easy-Barbecue-Chicken-Naan-Pizzas--9350630","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ngYJ2DBsxPhw4hq3jt2SxVMvkxrOEMI5aACJxVKtDewwFGDwdv9MSswp8C1aK69S_ARnea5_yhM3DyIwaWLiqi4=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":10,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Top each pizza with equal amounts of tomato and cilantro, then drizzle with reserved barbecue sauce. Slice and serve. Refrigerate leftovers in an airtight container for up to 2 days. Reheat in the oven at 350°F for 5-7 minutes.","name":"Step 11: Top each pizza with…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-and-Easy-Barbecue-Chicken-Naan-Pizzas--9350630","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ngYJ2DBsxPhw4hq3jt2SxVMvkxrOEMI5aACJxVKtDewwFGDwdv9MSswp8C1aK69S_ARnea5_yhM3DyIwaWLiqi4=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":11,"author":"Yummly","publisher