:{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Allow vegetables to cool slightly. Serve and enjoy.","name":"Step 10: Allow vegetables to…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Easy-Roasted-Garlic-_-Parmesan-Veggies-9350587","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Y_mbA2EUjufYarwNxfN0AevnYBy19jnsArIJCJ1z1kPeT5mdBtpWa8bFBXpbXS3fyk9cxprAKuWBlh7O6PmChys=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":10,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}}],"url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Easy-Roasted-Garlic-_-Parmesan-Veggies-9350587","position":6},{"@context":"https://schema.org/","@type":"Recipe","description":"Dreaming of a vacation to the South of Italy? Bring the flavors of Naples to your home kitchen with these quick and easy Margherita naan pizzas. The recipe is a Yummly original created by [Sara Mellas](https://www.yummly.com/dish/author/Sara%20Mellas).","image":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WJ6mW1AdqIHVVmwtKDHWm8emhU_FrJXeT701_xoSXKzH8bcShL7rnUoT48FLMaQYf96Rl1RM03HFENYmB8CwwA=w1920-h1920-c-rj-v1-e365","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WJ6mW1AdqIHVVmwtKDHWm8emhU_FrJXeT701_xoSXKzH8bcShL7rnUoT48FLMaQYf96Rl1RM03HFENYmB8CwwA=w1920-h1440-c-rj-v1-e365","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WJ6mW1AdqIHVVmwtKDHWm8emhU_FrJXeT701_xoSXKzH8bcShL7rnUoT48FLMaQYf96Rl1RM03HFENYmB8CwwA=w1920-h1080-c-rj-v1-e365"],"mainEntity":false,"name":"Quick Margherita Naan Pizzas","video":[{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"Quick Margherita Naan Pizzas","description":"Cooking video for Quick Margherita Naan Pizzas by Yummly on Yummly","contentUrl":"https://gv.yummlystatic.com/sbR2QISwa2l3h8EgrzZQ_Montage_Easy_Pizza_Margherita/sbR2QISwa2l3h8EgrzZQ_Montage_Easy_Pizza_Margherita-hls.m3u8","thumbnailUrl":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WJ6mW1AdqIHVVmwtKDHWm8emhU_FrJXeT701_xoSXKzH8bcShL7rnUoT48FLMaQYf96Rl1RM03HFENYmB8CwwA","uploadDate":"2021-02-13"}],"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Yummly"},"totalTime":"PT25M","recipeYield":4,"nutrition":{"@type":"NutritionInformation","calories":"330 calories","carbohydrateContent":"38 grams","cholesterolContent":"35 milligrams","fatContent":"12 grams","fiberContent":"2 grams","proteinContent":"16 grams","saturatedFatContent":"6 grams","sodiumContent":"810 milligrams","sugarContent":"2 grams"},"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":4.842105263157895,"reviewCount":38},"reviews":[{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2021-02-09","reviewBody":"It was just delicious, any didn’t take too long tol make","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Dianne7"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Quick Margherita Naan Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":4}},{"@type":"Review","dateCreated":"2021-01-17","reviewBody":"Delish! \nI made some minor changes: I used garlic naan instead of plain, skipped the minced garlic and replaced it with a pinch of garlic powder instead, and was very generous with the olive oil. \nOverall I cooked it for about 16 minutes, and it was nice and crispy, but could have even gone another minute or two. \nIt tasted wonderful and is absolutely a keeper.","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"MaeVerini"},"itemReviewed":{"@type":"Thing","name":"Quick Margherita Naan Pizzas"},"reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","bestRating":5,"worstRating":1,"ratingValue":5}}],"cookingMethod":["Baking"],"keywords":"Quick, Pizza, Baking","recipeIngredient":["4 pieces naan ","2 teaspoons extra-virgin olive oil ","2/3 cup pizza sauce or marinara sauce","6 ounces fresh mozzarella cheese ","1 large tomato ","2 cloves garlic ","4 basil leaves ","sea salt flakes "],"recipeInstructions":[{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Preheat oven to 425°F.","name":"Step 1: Preheat oven to 425…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-Margherita-Naan-Pizzas-9351324","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WJ6mW1AdqIHVVmwtKDHWm8emhU_FrJXeT701_xoSXKzH8bcShL7rnUoT48FLMaQYf96Rl1RM03HFENYmB8CwwA=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":1,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Line a baking sheet with parchment paper. ","name":"Step 2: Line a baking sheet…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-Margherita-Naan-Pizzas-9351324","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WJ6mW1AdqIHVVmwtKDHWm8emhU_FrJXeT701_xoSXKzH8bcShL7rnUoT48FLMaQYf96Rl1RM03HFENYmB8CwwA=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":2,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Arrange the naan on the baking sheet. Drizzle an equal amount of the olive oil over the surface of each piece.","name":"Step 3: Arrange the naan on…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-Margherita-Naan-Pizzas-9351324","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WJ6mW1AdqIHVVmwtKDHWm8emhU_FrJXeT701_xoSXKzH8bcShL7rnUoT48FLMaQYf96Rl1RM03HFENYmB8CwwA=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":3,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Spread a generous 2 tablespoons of pizza sauce evenly onto the center of each naan piece, leaving a 1/2-inch border around the sauce.","name":"Step 4: Spread a generous 2…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-Margherita-Naan-Pizzas-9351324","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WJ6mW1AdqIHVVmwtKDHWm8emhU_FrJXeT701_xoSXKzH8bcShL7rnUoT48FLMaQYf96Rl1RM03HFENYmB8CwwA=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":4,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Slice the mozzarella into 1/4-inch thick rounds.","name":"Step 5: Slice the mozzarell…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-Margherita-Naan-Pizzas-9351324","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WJ6mW1AdqIHVVmwtKDHWm8emhU_FrJXeT701_xoSXKzH8bcShL7rnUoT48FLMaQYf96Rl1RM03HFENYmB8CwwA=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":5,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Halve the tomato and remove and discard the seeds. Dice tomato into 1/4-inch pieces.","name":"Step 6: Halve the tomato an…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-Margherita-Naan-Pizzas-9351324","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WJ6mW1AdqIHVVmwtKDHWm8emhU_FrJXeT701_xoSXKzH8bcShL7rnUoT48FLMaQYf96Rl1RM03HFENYmB8CwwA=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":6,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Finely mince the garlic.","name":"Step 7: Finely mince the ga…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-Margherita-Naan-Pizzas-9351324","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WJ6mW1AdqIHVVmwtKDHWm8emhU_FrJXeT701_xoSXKzH8bcShL7rnUoT48FLMaQYf96Rl1RM03HFENYmB8CwwA=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":7,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Stack the basil leaves and roll into a tight log. Make very thin slices across the log to create ribbons.","name":"Step 8: Stack the basil lea…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-Margherita-Naan-Pizzas-9351324","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WJ6mW1AdqIHVVmwtKDHWm8emhU_FrJXeT701_xoSXKzH8bcShL7rnUoT48FLMaQYf96Rl1RM03HFENYmB8CwwA=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":8,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Distribute mozzarella equally between each piece of naan. Add the diced tomato, minced garlic, and half of the basil leaves. Reserve remaining basil for garnish.","name":"Step 9: Distribute mozzarel…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-Margherita-Naan-Pizzas-9351324","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WJ6mW1AdqIHVVmwtKDHWm8emhU_FrJXeT701_xoSXKzH8bcShL7rnUoT48FLMaQYf96Rl1RM03HFENYmB8CwwA=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":9,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Bake pizzas on middle rack of oven until the naan is crisp and the cheese is bubbly and golden, 12-14 minutes.","name":"Step 10: Bake pizzas on midd…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-Margherita-Naan-Pizzas-9351324","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WJ6mW1AdqIHVVmwtKDHWm8emhU_FrJXeT701_xoSXKzH8bcShL7rnUoT48FLMaQYf96Rl1RM03HFENYmB8CwwA=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":10,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Check to see that pizzas are done. Remove from oven or add time as needed.","name":"Step 11: Check to see that p…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-Margherita-Naan-Pizzas-9351324","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WJ6mW1AdqIHVVmwtKDHWm8emhU_FrJXeT701_xoSXKzH8bcShL7rnUoT48FLMaQYf96Rl1RM03HFENYmB8CwwA=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":11,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Allow pizzas to cool for 2-3 minutes. Top with reserved basil ribbons and a sprinkle of flaky sea salt, then slice and serve. Refrigerate leftovers in an airtight container for up to 2 days. Reheat in the oven at 350°F for 5-7 minutes.","name":"Step 12: Allow pizzas to coo…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-Margherita-Naan-Pizzas-9351324","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WJ6mW1AdqIHVVmwtKDHWm8emhU_FrJXeT701_xoSXKzH8bcShL7rnUoT48FLMaQYf96Rl1RM03HFENYmB8CwwA=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":12,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}}],"url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Quick-Margherita-Naan-Pizzas-9351324","position":7},{"@context":"https://schema.org/","@type":"Recipe","description":"These Chicken & Pesto Naan Pizzas are the perfect way to use up leftover rotisserie chicken. Fast, filling, and flavorful! The recipe is a Yummly original created by [Sara Mellas](https://www.yummly.com/dish/author/Sara%20Mellas).","image":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Ptm7Vb8MZsqmfap-iR-F0WIzudyvA0bCoEo1cC06fCAAwtrCtrxAVPnS82ezdJsRDid3lXc5M7P7S4ZOfcp7=w1920-h1920-c-rj-v1-e365","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Ptm7Vb8MZsqmfap-iR-F0WIzudyvA0bCoEo1cC06fCAAwtrCtrxAVPnS82ezdJsRDid3lXc5M7P7S4ZOfcp7=w1920-h1440-c-rj-v1-e365","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Ptm7Vb8MZsqmfap-iR-F0WIzudyvA0bCoEo1cC06fCAAwtrCtrxAVPnS82ezdJsRDid3lXc5M7P7S4ZOfcp7=w1920-h1080-c-rj-v1-e365"],"mainEntity":false,"name":"Chicken Pesto Naan Pizzas","video":[{"@type":"VideoObject","name":"Chicken Pesto Naan Pizzas","description":"Cooking video for Chicken Pesto Naan Pizzas by Yummly on Yummly","contentUrl":"https://gv.yummlystatic.com/HpjjjY8TStyqY2t5WCKe_Montage_Easy_Pizza_Chicken_Pesto/HpjjjY8TStyqY2t5WCKe_Montage_Easy_Pizza_Chicken_Pesto-hls.m3u8","thumbnailUrl":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Ptm7Vb8MZsqmfap-iR-F0WIzudyvA0bCoEo1cC06fCAAwtrCtrxAVPnS82ezdJsRDid3lXc5M7P7S4ZOfcp7","uploadDate":"2020-10-21"}],"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Yummly"},"totalTime":"PT20M","recipeYield":4,"nutrition":{"@type":"Nut