":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Line a baking sheet with parchment paper. ","name":"Step 2: Line a baking sheet…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Chicken-Pesto-Naan-Pizzas-9339355","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Ptm7Vb8MZsqmfap-iR-F0WIzudyvA0bCoEo1cC06fCAAwtrCtrxAVPnS82ezdJsRDid3lXc5M7P7S4ZOfcp7=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":2,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Arrange the naan on the baking sheet.","name":"Step 3: Arrange the naan on…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Chicken-Pesto-Naan-Pizzas-9339355","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Ptm7Vb8MZsqmfap-iR-F0WIzudyvA0bCoEo1cC06fCAAwtrCtrxAVPnS82ezdJsRDid3lXc5M7P7S4ZOfcp7=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":3,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Divide the pesto sauce equally between the naan pieces and spread into an even layer, leaving a 1/2-inch border around the sauce.","name":"Step 4: Divide the pesto sa…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Chicken-Pesto-Naan-Pizzas-9339355","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Ptm7Vb8MZsqmfap-iR-F0WIzudyvA0bCoEo1cC06fCAAwtrCtrxAVPnS82ezdJsRDid3lXc5M7P7S4ZOfcp7=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":4,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Arrange equal amounts of shredded chicken and cheese on each piece of naan.","name":"Step 5: Arrange equal amoun…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Chicken-Pesto-Naan-Pizzas-9339355","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Ptm7Vb8MZsqmfap-iR-F0WIzudyvA0bCoEo1cC06fCAAwtrCtrxAVPnS82ezdJsRDid3lXc5M7P7S4ZOfcp7=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":5,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Bake the pizzas on lower-middle rack of oven until the naan is crisp and the cheese is bubbly and golden, 13-15 minutes.","name":"Step 6: Bake the pizzas on…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Chicken-Pesto-Naan-Pizzas-9339355","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Ptm7Vb8MZsqmfap-iR-F0WIzudyvA0bCoEo1cC06fCAAwtrCtrxAVPnS82ezdJsRDid3lXc5M7P7S4ZOfcp7=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":6,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Check to see that pizzas are done. Remove from oven or add time as needed.","name":"Step 7: Check to see that p…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Chicken-Pesto-Naan-Pizzas-9339355","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Ptm7Vb8MZsqmfap-iR-F0WIzudyvA0bCoEo1cC06fCAAwtrCtrxAVPnS82ezdJsRDid3lXc5M7P7S4ZOfcp7=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":7,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Halve the tomato, and remove and discard the seeds. Dice tomato into 1/4-inch pieces.","name":"Step 8: Halve the tomato, a…","url":"https://www.yummly.com/recipe/Chicken-Pesto-Naan-Pizzas-9339355","image":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Ptm7Vb8MZsqmfap-iR-F0WIzudyvA0bCoEo1cC06fCAAwtrCtrxAVPnS82ezdJsRDid3lXc5M7P7S4ZOfcp7=w1200-h630-pp-rj-v1-e365","position":8,"author":"Yummly","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Yummly","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://x.yummlystatic.com/web/yummly.svg"}}},{"@type":"HowToStep","text":"Top each pizza with an equal amount of diced tomato, then slice and serve. Refrigerate leftovers in an airtight co