B%22step%22%3A%22Divide%20the%20pesto%20sauce%20equally%20between%20the%20naan%20pieces%20and%20spread%20into%20an%20even%20layer%2C%20leaving%20a%201/2-inch%20border%20around%20the%20sauce.%22%2C%22index%22%3A3%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Arrange%20equal%20amounts%20of%20shredded%20chicken%20and%20cheese%20on%20each%20piece%20of%20naan.%22%2C%22index%22%3A4%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Bake%20the%20pizzas%20on%20lower-middle%20rack%20of%20oven%20until%20the%20naan%20is%20crisp%20and%20the%20cheese%20is%20bubbly%20and%20golden%2C%2013-15%20minutes.%22%2C%22index%22%3A5%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Check%20to%20see%20that%20pizzas%20are%20done.%20Remove%20from%20oven%20or%20add%20time%20as%20needed.%22%2C%22index%22%3A6%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Halve%20the%20tomato%2C%20and%20remove%20and%20discard%20the%20seeds.%20Dice%20tomato%20into%201/4-inch%20pieces.%22%2C%22index%22%3A7%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Top%20each%20pizza%20with%20an%20equal%20amount%20of%20diced%20tomato%2C%20then%20slice%20and%20serve.%20Refrigerate%20leftovers%20in%20an%20airtight%20container%20for%20up%20to%202%20days.%20Reheat%20in%20the%20oven%20at%20350%B0F%20for%205-7%20minutes.%22%2C%22index%22%3A8%7D%5D%2C%22nativeAdInfo%22%3Anull%2C%22promoted%22%3Afalse%2C%22tags%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22Main%20Dishes%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Course%3A%20Main%20Dishes%22%2C%22hidden%22%3Afalse%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Quick%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Difficulty%3A%20Quick%22%2C%22hidden%22%3Afalse%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Pizza%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Dish%3A%20Pizza%22%2C%22hidden%22%3Afalse%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Low%20Sugar%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Nutrition%3A%20Low%20Sugar%22%2C%22hidden%22%3Afalse%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Baking%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Technique%3A%20Baking%22%2C%22hidden%22%3Afalse%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Low%20Sodium%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Nutrition%3A%20Low%20Sodium%22%2C%22hidden%22%3Afalse%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Low%20Saturated%20Fat%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Nutrition%3A%