i6cjFdlKJijdoDQSX1ZzyBmmKtjMLHj-Z7ihRNMZPA%22%2C%22imageHeight%22%3A1080%2C%22imageWidth%22%3A1920%2C%22showInlinePrepSteps%22%3Atrue%2C%22alternateExternalUrls%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22prepStepCount%22%3A8%2C%22prepSteps%22%3A%5B%7B%22step%22%3A%22Whisk%20together%20yeast%2C%20water%2C%20and%20sugar%20in%20a%20mixing%20bowl%20until%20frothy.%20Add%20olive%20oil%20and%20Greek%20yogurt.%20Stir%20to%20combine.%20Add%20flour%2C%20salt%2C%20and%20baking%20soda%20to%20the%20bowl.%20Stir%20with%20a%20wooden%20spoon%20until%20dry%20ingredients%20are%20combined%20into%20wet%20ingredients.%22%2C%22index%22%3A0%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Using%20clean%20hands%2C%20knead%20the%20mixture%20for%201-2%20minutes%2C%20until%20a%20tacky%20dough%20forms.%20Cover%20the%20bowl%20with%20plastic%20wrap%20or%20a%20clean%20kitchen%20towel%20and%20set%20aside%20to%20rise%20for%202%20hours%2C%20or%20until%20doubled%20in%20volume.%22%2C%22index%22%3A1%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Place%20a%20pizza%20stone%20on%20the%20middle%20rack%20of%20oven.%20Preheat%20oven%20to%20450%B0F.%22%2C%22index%22%3A2%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Turn%20dough%20onto%20a%20well-floured%20surface%20and%20divide%20into%206%20equal%20pieces.%20Use%20a%20rolling%20pin%20to%20roll%20each%20piece%20to%20a%20scant%201/4-inch%20thick.%22%2C%22index%22%3A3%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Open%20oven%20and%20swiftly%20place%20naan%20dough%20pieces%20on%20the%20pizza%20stone.%20Bake%20for%205%20minutes%2C%20until%20slightly%20risen.%22%2C%22index%22%3A4%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Open%20oven%20once%20more%2C%20and%20flip%20the%20naan.%20Continue%20baking%20for%203%20minutes%2C%20until%20golden%20brown%20on%20both%20sides.%22%2C%22index%22%3A5%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Check%20to%20see%20that%20naan%20is%20done.%20Remove%20from%20oven%20or%20add%20time%20as%20needed.%22%2C%22index%22%3A6%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Brush%20naan%20on%20both%20sides%20with%20melted%20butter%2C%20as%20desired%2C%20and%20serve.%22%2C%22index%22%3A7%7D%5D%2C%22nativeAdInfo%22%3Anull%2