0Was%20amazing%2C%20will%20do%20again%22%7D%5D%2C%22rating%22%3A%7B%22myReview%22%3Anull%2C%22score%22%3A5%2C%22reviewCount%22%3A8%7D%2C%22tagCategories%22%3A%7B%22course%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22difficulty%22%3A%5B%7B%22display-name%22%3A%22Quick%22%2C%22tag-url%22%3A%22difficulty%5Edifficulty-quick%22%7D%5D%2C%22technique%22%3A%5B%7B%22display-name%22%3A%22Baking%22%2C%22tag-url%22%3A%22technique%5Etechnique-baking%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22units%22%3A%22IMPERIAL%22%2C%22servings%22%3A4%2C%22displayServings%22%3A4%2C%22image%22%3A%22https%3A//lh3.googleusercontent.com/4Qxl5B5K55B0tDsRGs0msRFdxpxsouyP5EElSEDDcCCN-Oc4v7alVh97DmclgWSXpJUgP4f8LfH6Je2tVJrxEQ%22%2C%22imageHeight%22%3A1080%2C%22imageWidth%22%3A1920%2C%22showInlinePrepSteps%22%3Atrue%2C%22alternateExternalUrls%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22prepStepCount%22%3A10%2C%22prepSteps%22%3A%5B%7B%22step%22%3A%22Preheat%20oven%20to%20425%B0F.%22%2C%22index%22%3A0%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Line%20a%20baking%20sheet%20with%20parchment%20paper.%20%22%2C%22index%22%3A1%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Arrange%20the%20naan%20on%20the%20baking%20sheet.%20Drizzle%20an%20equal%20amount%20of%20the%20olive%20oil%20over%20the%20surface%20of%20each%20piece.%22%2C%22index%22%3A2%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Thinly%20slice%20the%20eggplant%20into%201/8-inch%20thick%20rounds.%20Cut%20each%20round%20in%20half.%22%2C%22index%22%3A3%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Stack%20the%20basil%20leaves%20and%20roll%20into%20a%20tight%20log.%20Make%20very%20thin%20slices%20across%20the%20log%20to%20create%20ribbons.%22%2C%22index%22%3A4%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Divide%20the%20pizza%20sauce%20equally%20on%20each%20naan%20piece%20and%20spread%20it%20into%20an%20even%20layer%2C%20leaving%20a%201/2-inch%20border%20around%20the%20sauce.%22%2C%22index%22%3A5%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Spread%20eggplant%20slices%20evenly%20over%20each%20piece%20of%20naan%2C%20then%20add%20a%20sprinkling%20of%20shredded%20cheese%2C%20drops%20of%20ricotta%20cheese%2C%20and%20half%20of%20the%20basil%20ribbons.%20Reserve%20remaining%20basil%20for%20garnish.%22%2C%22index%22%3A6%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Bake%20the%20pizzas%20on%20middle%20rack%20of%20oven%20until%20the%20naan%20is%20crisp%20and%20the%20cheese%20is%20bubbly%20and%20golden%2C%2014-15%20minutes.%22%2C%22index%22%3A7%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Check%20to%20see%20that%20pizzas%20are%20done.%20Remove%20from%20oven%20or%20add%20time%20as%20needed.%22%2C%22index%22%3A8%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Allow%20pizzas%20to%20cool%20on%20the%20baking%20sheet%20for%202-3%20minutes.%20Top%20with%20reserved%20basil%20ribbons%20and%20a%20sprinkle%20of%20Parmesan%20cheese%2C%20if%20desired.%20Slice%20and%20serve.%20Refrigerate%20leftovers%20in%20an%20airtight%20container%20for%20up%20to%202%20days.%20Reheat%20in%20the%20oven%20at%20350%B0F%20for%205-7%20minutes.%22%2C%22index%22%3A9%7D%5D%2C%22nativeAdInfo%22%3Anull%2C%22promoted%22%3Afalse%2C%22tags%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22Quick%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Difficulty%3A%20Quick%22%2C%22hidden%22%3Afalse%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Baking%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Technique%3A%20Baking%22%2C%22hidden%22%3Afalse%7D%5D%2C%22ingredientLines%22%3A%7B%22imperial%22%3A%5B%7B%22ingredient%22%3A%22naan%22%2C%22ingredientId%22%3A%224112436f-3f81-4019-97ca-e886c8fd9641%22%2C%22checked%22%3Afalse%2C%22category%22%3A%22bakery%22%2C%22categoryId%22%3A%22a18ef82c-56c9-4ace-9283-cfe9dcda1731%22%2C%22remainder%22%3A%22%22%2C%22amount%22%3A4%2C%22abbreviation%22%3A%22piece%22%2C%22pluralAbbreviation%22%3A%22pieces%22%2C%22decimal%22%3Afalse%2C%22unit%22%3A%22piece%22%2C%22pluralUnit%22%3A%22pieces%22%7D%2C%7B%22ingredient%22%3A%22extra-virgin%20olive%20oil%22%2C%22ingredientId%22%3A%226ea1b4fd-e6a0-4eec-ae75-2bba261ae482%22%2C%22checked%22%3Afalse%2C%22category%22%3A%22baking%20%26%20cooking%22%2C%22categoryId%22%3A%2248481730-6064-11e9-8647-d663bd873d93%22%2C%22remainder%22%3A%22%22%2C%22amount%22%3A2%2C%22abbreviation%22%3A%22tsp.%22%2C%22pluralAbbreviation%22%3A%22tsp.%22%2C%22decimal%22%3Afalse%2C%22unit%22%3A%22