ture%3Fheight%3D180%26width%3D180%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22249bead3-93e2-4511-aa71-1c303ae7e35d%22%2C%22lastName%22%3A%22%22%2C%22userName%22%3A%22MaeVerini%22%7D%2C%22rating%22%3A5%2C%22text%22%3A%22Delish%21%20%5CnI%20made%20some%20minor%20changes%3A%20I%20used%20garlic%20naan%20instead%20of%20plain%2C%20skipped%20the%20minced%20garlic%20and%20replaced%20it%20with%20a%20pinch%20of%20garlic%20powder%20instead%2C%20and%20was%20very%20generous%20with%20the%20olive%20oil.%20%5CnOverall%20I%20cooked%20it%20for%20about%2016%20minutes%2C%20and%20it%20was%20nice%20and%20crispy%2C%20but%20could%20have%20even%20gone%20another%20minute%20or%20two.%20%5CnIt%20tasted%20wonderful%20and%20is%20absolutely%20a%20keeper.%22%7D%5D%2C%22rating%22%3A%7B%22myReview%22%3Anull%2C%22score%22%3A4.842105263157895%2C%22reviewCount%22%3A38%7D%2C%22tagCategories%22%3A%7B%22course%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22difficulty%22%3A%5B%7B%22display-name%22%3A%22Quick%22%2C%22tag-url%22%3A%22difficulty%5Edifficulty-quick%22%7D%5D%2C%22dish%22%3A%5B%7B%22display-name%22%3A%22Pizza%22%2C%22tag-url%22%3A%22dish%5Edish-pizza%22%7D%5D%2C%22technique%22%3A%5B%7B%22display-name%22%3A%22Baking%22%2C%22tag-url%22%3A%22technique%5Etechnique-baking%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22units%22%3A%22IMPERIAL%22%2C%22servings%22%3A4%2C%22displayServings%22%3A4%2C%22image%22%3A%22https%3A//lh3.googleusercontent.com/WJ6mW1AdqIHVVmwtKDHWm8emhU_FrJXeT701_xoSXKzH8bcShL7rnUoT48FLMaQYf96Rl1RM03HFENYmB8CwwA%22%2C%22imageHeight%22%3A1080%2C%22imageWidth%22%3A1920%2C%22showInlinePrepSteps%22%3Atrue%2C%22alternateExternalUrls%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22prepStepCount%22%3A12%2C%22prepSteps%22%3A%5B%7B%22step%22%3A%22Preheat%20oven%20to%20425%B0F.%22%2C%22index%22%3A0%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Line%20a%20baking%20sheet%20with%20parchment%20paper.%20%22%2C%22index%22%3A1%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Arrange%20the%20naan%20on%20the%20baking%20sheet.%20Drizzle%20an%20equal%20amount%20of%20the%20olive%20oil%20over%20the%20surface%20of%20each%20piece.%22%2C%22index%22%3A2%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Spread%20a%20generous%202%20tablespoons%20of%20pizza%20sauce%20evenly%20onto%20the%20center%20of%20each%20naan%20piece%2C%20leaving%20a%201/2-inch%20border%20around%20the%20sauce.%22%2C%22index%22%3A3%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Slice%20the%20mozzarella%20into%201/4-inch%20thick%20rounds.%22%2C%22index%22%3A4%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Halve%20the%20tomato%20and%20remove%20and%20discard%20the%20seeds.%20Dice%20tomato%20into%201/4-inch%20pieces.%22%2C%22index%22%3A5%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Finely%20mince%20the%20garlic.%22%2C%22index%22%3A6%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Stack%20the%20basil%20leaves%20and%20roll%20into%20a%20tight%20log.%20Make%20very%20thin%20slices%20across%20the%20log%20to%20create%20ribbons.%22%2C%22index%22%3A7%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Distribute%20mozzarella%20equally%20between%20each%20piece%20of%20naan.%20Add%20the%20diced%20tomato%2C%20minced%20garlic%2C%20and%20half%20of%20the%20basil%20leaves.%20Reserve%20remaining%20basil%20for%20garnish.%22%2C%22index%22%3A8%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Bake%20pizzas%20on%20middle%20rack%20of%20oven%20until%20the%20naan%20is%20crisp%20and%20the%20cheese%20is%20bubbly%20and%20golden%2C%2012-14%20minutes.%22%2C%22index%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Check%20to%20see%20that%20pizzas%20are%20done.%20Remove%20from%20oven%20or%20add%20time%20as%20needed.%22%2C%22index%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Allow%20pizzas%20to%20cool%20for%202-3%20minutes.%20Top%20with%20reserved%20basil%20ribbons%20and%20a%20sprinkle%20of%20flaky%20sea%20salt%2C%20then%20slice%20and%20serve.%20Refrigerate%20leftovers%20in%20an%20airtight%20container%20for%20up%20to%202%20days.%20Reheat%20in%20the%20oven%20at%20350%B0F%20for%205-7%20minutes.%22%2C%22index%22%3A11%7D%5D%2C%22nativeAdInfo%22%3Anull%2C%22promoted%22%3Afalse%2C%22tags%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22Quick%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Difficulty%3A%20Quick%22%2C%22hidden%22%3Afalse%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Pizza%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Dish%3A%20Pizza%22%2C%22hidden%22%3Afalse%7D%2C%7B