0naan%20on%20one%20baking%20sheet%2C%20then%20brush%20the%20surface%20of%20each%20naan%20piece%20with%20melted%20butter.%22%2C%22index%22%3A4%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Arrange%20the%20bacon%20strips%20on%20the%20other%20baking%20sheet.%22%2C%22index%22%3A5%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Halve%20the%20tomato%20and%20remove%20and%20discard%20the%20seeds.%20Dice%20tomato%20into%201/4%20inch%20pieces.%22%2C%22index%22%3A6%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Finely%20mince%20the%20chives.%20Set%20aside.%22%2C%22index%22%3A7%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Sprinkle%20an%20equal%20amount%20of%20shredded%20mozzarella%20and%20cheddar%20cheeses%20over%20each%20pizza.%22%2C%22index%22%3A8%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Carefully%20crack%20one%20egg%20into%20the%20center%20of%20each%20pizza.%22%2C%22index%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Bake%20the%20pizzas%20and%20bacon%20on%20the%20middle%20and%20upper-middle%20racks%20of%20oven%20until%20the%20cheese%20is%20golden%2C%20the%20eggs%20are%20fully%20cooked%2C%20and%20the%20bacon%20is%20browned%20and%20crisp%2C%2014-16%20minutes.%22%2C%22index%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Check%20to%20see%20that%20bacon%20and%20pizzas%20are%20done.%20Remove%20from%20oven%20or%20add%20time%20as%20needed.%22%2C%22index%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Transfer%20the%20cooked%20bacon%20to%20the%20paper-towel-lined%20dinner%20plate%20to%20drain.%22%2C%22index%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Halve%20the%20avocado%20and%20remove%20and%20discard%20the%20pit.%20Cut%20the%20avocado%20into%201/4-inch%20thick%20slices.%20Carefully%20scoop%20out%20the%20slices%20with%20a%20spoon.%22%2C%22index%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22step%22%3A%22Arrange%20equal%20amounts%20of%20avocado%20slices%20and%20diced%20tomatoes%20on%20each%20pizza.%20With%20clean%20hands%2C%20crumble%20the%20bacon%20and%20sprinkle%20evenly%20over%20the%20pizzas%2C%20then%20sprinkle%20with%20minced%20chives.%20Season%20with%20salt%20and%20pepper%2C%20to%20taste%2C%20and%20serve%20immediately.%22%2C%22index%22%3A14%7D%5D%2C%22nativeAdInfo%22